<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < \old(this.size()) && i != index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>

This assert statement ensures that for every index `i` less than the initial size of the vector and not equal to the given index, the element at `i` remains unchanged after the removal operation.
